sequenceDiagram
    loop Each retry
        A->>B: try
        alt Accepted
            B-->>A: ok
        else Rejected
            B-->>A: no
        end
    end
    opt Cache
        A->>C: store
    end
    par First
        A->>B: one
    and Second
        A->>C: two
    end
    critical Lock
        B->>C: hold
    option Timeout
        B-xC: drop
    end
    break Shutdown
        C->>A: bye
    end
    rect rgba(255, 200, 0, 0.2)
        Note over A,C: Shared note
    end
    Note left of A: left
    Note right of C: right<br>side
    Note over B: over
    autonumber 10 5
    A->>B: numbered
    autonumber off
